  "bodyHtml": "<main class=\"main\"><section  class=\"cb-hero cb-hero--type-one cb-hero--align-centre  cb-hero6a0df8eabfcf7\" data-delay=\"2500\" data-loop=\"1\" data-autoplay=\"1\"><div class=\"cb-hero__container\"><div class=\"cb-hero__text-block\"><div class=\"cb-hero__text\"><h1>Dalton Walsh</h1></div><p class=\"typewrite cb-hero__static-sub-heading\" data-pause=\"2000\" data-type='[\n\"Front End Developer\",\n\"Wordpress Developer\",\n\"Email Developer\",\n\"Drummer\",\n\"Web Developer\",\n\"Gamer\",\n]'><span class=\"wrap\"></span></p><span class=\"caret\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></section><section id=\"xmas-top-left\" class=\"cb-image-text cb-image-text6a0df8eabfee0 cb-image-text--type-one cb-image-text--align-centre \" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__text-block\"><h2 class=\"cb-image-text__heading\">\nAbout me</h2><div class=\"cb-image-text__text\"><p>Hi, I’m Dalton Walsh, a Front End Developer based in Manchester, currently working at a digital advertising agency. With over a decade of experience, I&#8217;ve had the opportunity to collaborate with some big-name clients, lead exciting projects, pitch fresh ideas, and mentor team members to expand their skills.</p><p>What drives me most is my passion for continuous learning—the web evolves constantly, making every day a new chance to tackle fresh challenges. I genuinely enjoy how this industry perfectly blends creativity with problem-solving, keeping the work engaging and rewarding.</p><p>Do you have a website idea you&#8217;d like to bring to life? Let&#8217;s chat! I&#8217;m always keen to explore new projects and collaborations</p></div></div><div class=\"cb-image-text__image-block\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__image\"><div class=\"swiper-container\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2021/03/image-1-768x606.jpg\" width=\"768\" height=\"606\" data-src=\"/media/2021/03/image-1-768x606.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large\" alt=\"Dalton Walsh WordPress Developer\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2021/03/image-1-768x606.jpg 768w, /media/2021/03/image-1-300x237.jpg 300w, /media/2021/03/image-1-1024x807.jpg 1024w, /media/2021/03/image-1-1536x1211.jpg 1536w, /media/2021/03/image-1.jpg 1910w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" / srcset=\"/media/2021/03/image-1-768x606.jpg 768w, /media/2021/03/image-1-300x237.jpg 300w, /media/2021/03/image-1-1024x807.jpg 1024w, /media/2021/03/image-1-1536x1211.jpg 1536w, /media/2021/03/image-1.jpg 1910w\"></div></div><div class=\"swiper-pagination\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"brands\" class=\"cb-text-box cb-text-box6a0df8eac0269 cb-text-box--type-one cb-text-box--align-centre\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__container padding-top-sm padding-bottom-sm\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__text\"><p><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2023/05/portfolio.png\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2279 size-full\" data-src=\"/media/2023/05/portfolio.png\" alt=\"Brands i've worked with\" width=\"900\" height=\"580\" data-srcset=\"/media/2023/05/portfolio.png 900w, /media/2023/05/portfolio-300x193.png 300w, /media/2023/05/portfolio-768x495.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" / srcset=\"/media/2023/05/portfolio.png 900w, /media/2023/05/portfolio-300x193.png 300w, /media/2023/05/portfolio-768x495.png 768w\"></p><p>Here are some of the big name brands that I&#8217;ve worked with. Check out some examples of my <strong><a href=\"/work\">work</a>.</strong></p></div></div></section><section id=\"xmas-bottom-right\" class=\"cb-image-text cb-image-text6a0df8eac02b1 cb-image-text--type-one cb-image-text--align-centre cb-image-text--type-one--reversed\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__text-block\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__text\"><p>My coding journey started in <a href=\"/portfolio/redc-email/\">email development</a>, creating everything from crisp, professional newsletters to fun and <a href=\"/blog/quirky-email-things/\">experimental projects</a> designed to impress clients. Now, my focus is building dynamic and efficient websites using Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, Sanity, and Shopify. I pride myself on writing clean, modular code that is maintainable and scalable.</p><p>Outside of work, I&#8217;m embracing life as a new dad and competing in Flyball with my dogs. When I&#8217;m not busy with family adventures or canine competitions, you&#8217;ll find me working on personal coding <a href=\"/blog/ai-adventures-how-i-built-a-text-based-rpg/\">projects</a> or exploring the latest tech trends.</p></div></div><div class=\"cb-image-text__image-block\"><div class=\"cb-image-text__image\"><div class=\"swiper-container\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2021/03/code-screenshot.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" data-src=\"/media/2021/03/code-screenshot.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large\" alt=\"screenshot of javascript and css code for WordPress site\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2021/03/code-screenshot.jpg 640w, /media/2021/03/code-screenshot-300x200.jpg 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" / srcset=\"/media/2021/03/code-screenshot.jpg 640w, /media/2021/03/code-screenshot-300x200.jpg 300w\"></div></div><div class=\"swiper-pagination\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class=\"cb-stats cb-stats6a0df8eac05d5 cb-stats--type-one\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__container padding-top-none padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stats-group\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat\"><p class=\"cb-stats__stat--title\">HTML/CSS</p><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar--progress\" data-value=\"100\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"cb-stats__stat\"><p class=\"cb-stats__stat--title\">Wordpress</p><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar--progress\" data-value=\"77\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"cb-stats__stat\"><p class=\"cb-stats__stat--title\">JS</p><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar--progress\" data-value=\"82\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class=\"cb-articles-grid cb-articles-grid--type-two cb-articles-grid--align-leftcb-articles-grid--type-two--highlight-latest\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-articles-grid__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><h2 class=\"cb-articles-grid__heading\">\nLatest Work</h2><div class=\"cb-articles-grid__items\" data-items=\"4\" data-module-type=\"--type-two\" data-post-type=\"portfolio\"><article class=\"c-article-item\">\n<a class=\"c-article-item__link\" href=\"/portfolio/flyball-hub-next-js-typescript-supabase-pwa-app/\"><div class=\"c-article-item__image\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-1024x577.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"577\" data-src=\"/media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-1024x577.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Flyball Hub website screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-1024x577.webp 1024w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-300x169.webp 300w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-768x432.webp 768w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website.webp 1133w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" / srcset=\"/media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-1024x577.webp 1024w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-300x169.webp 300w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website-768x432.webp 768w, /media/2025/12/flyballhub-website.webp 1133w\"></div><p class=\"c-article-item__date\">14.12.25</p><div class=\"c-article-item__text\"><h3 class=\"c-article-item__title\">Flyball Hub &#8211; Next JS, Typescript, Supabase, PWA App</h3><p class=\"c-article-item__excerpt\"></p></div>